Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.66,0:04:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.35,0:04:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 先生们 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gentlemen. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.26,0:04:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此为何物\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.05,0:04:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教会评估调查 为本次调查之成果\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Valor Ecclesiasticus: the results of the Commissioner's.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.47,0:04:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}调查专员对全国范围内所有修道院进行了核查\N{\fnArial\fs30}investigations into the wealth and practices.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.69,0:04:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}核查内容涉及其财产及行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}of all the religious houses in Your Majesty's kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.94,0:04:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}经查 大小修道院\N{\fnArial\fs30}It lists the treasures, the wealth and.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.63,0:04:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及其它宗教组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}the vast private lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.06,0:04:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拥有大量私有土地\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the monasteries, priories and other religious establishments.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.74,0:04:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此外还有不计其数的放纵\N{\fnArial\fs30}It as well lists the innumerable cases of laxity,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.88,0:04:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}堕落 邪恶 以及欺诈行径\N{\fnArial\fs30}corruption, evil practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.66,0:04:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恶行如此之猖獗 从未加以遏制\N{\fnArial\fs30}and fraud which have flourished, unchecked, and in some cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.22,0:04:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更有甚者 在同一宗教机构内竞持续了百余年\N{\fnArial\fs30}for hundreds of years, in these same institutions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.49,0:04:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与此同时 陛下的国库亏空\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meanwhile, Majesty, your own treasury is much depleted.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.10,0:05:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}本应臣服于陛下的臣民如此富有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it not a thing to marvel at,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.83,0:05:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而国库却入不敷出\N{\fnArial\fs30}the richness of those who ought by right to be your subjects,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.87,0:05:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这难道不令人讶异吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the poverty and debt of the English Crown?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.51,0:05:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所言极是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.91,0:05:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}George!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.29,0:05:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亨利爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.21,0:05:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 我为谢尔顿女士而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty. I came again to pay court to Lady Sheldon,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.04,0:05:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已获国王陛下恩准\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the King's permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.90,0:05:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是的 当然 - 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. Yes, of course.- I…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.40,0:05:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我借此向陛下表达我的爱戴及忠诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I also wanted an opportunity to express my love and devotion to Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.53,0:05:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作为一名改革者\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a reformer myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.40,0:05:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我深谙您的功绩 虽不是为歌功颂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know all the good works you do, without ever seeking any praise,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.77,0:06:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但的确当之无愧\N{\fnArial\fs30}but always deserving it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.30,0:06:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我到修道院视察时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I visit religious houses,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.27,0:06:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}力劝那些神职人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do so to urge those inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.85,0:06:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}务必净化他们堕落的生活和教义\N{\fnArial\fs30}to cleanse and purify their corrupt lives and doctrine,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.90,0:06:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}否则必定走向毁灭之路\N{\fnArial\fs30}or else they will surely be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.24,0:06:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 的确如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Yes, it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.85,0:06:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们福音派教徒必须脱胎换骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}We evangelicals must breathe new life into dead bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.35,0:06:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鼓励无知的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and encourage the ignorant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.50,0:06:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有所信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}to believe in priority of faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.55,0:06:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}信奉上帝箴言\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the word of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.43,0:06:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们所见略同 亨利爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see we understand each other, Sir Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.26,0:06:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢尔顿女士…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Sheldon…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.63,0:06:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亨利·诺里斯爵士前来示好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Henry Norris has come courting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.77,0:06:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.37,0:06:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}臣告退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.11,0:06:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 您召见我？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You wanted to see me? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.49,0:07:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我又做了同样的梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had the dream again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.77,0:07:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 安妮 - 我早就说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anne! - I told you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.64,0:07:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我与她势不两立 - 看在上帝的份上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I am her death and she is mine. - For God's sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.37,0:07:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要她们还在世一天 我就不得安生\N{\fnArial\fs30}So long as they are both alive, I can't be safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.80,0:07:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳为什么还不死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why doesn't Katherine just die?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.78,0:07:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有人都跟我说她病入膏肓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone keeps telling me how ill she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.40,0:07:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 她为什么还不死 - 别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everyone keeps telling me how ill she is. Why doesn't she die? - Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.14,0:07:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有一计 下次亨利出访外国\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a thought. The next time Henry goes abroad,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.87,0:07:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将摄政 我就可下令处死她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall be left as Regent. I can just order their deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.37,0:07:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你疯了 行了 别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're crazy! Stop it! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.12,0:07:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.33,0:07:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可是英格兰的王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the Queen of England!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.93,0:07:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}得有个王后的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the love of God, act like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.23,0:07:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毕竟 你还侍奉过凯瑟琳王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all, you were a Lady to Queen Katherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.10,0:07:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的一言一行 你都看在眼里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw and heard how she behaved.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.10,0:07:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}依我之见 她从不会背叛自己的真实感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seemed to me she never betrayed her real feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.07,0:07:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就不能多向她学学？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you not be more like her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.10,0:07:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}向凯瑟琳学？\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like Katherine?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.50,0:08:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正是此意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. You heard me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.35,0:08:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至少表现出愉悦\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least seem happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.12,0:08:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而不是痛苦之态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a heap of misery!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.01,0:08:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}院长神父 院长神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father Abbot! Father Abbot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.32,0:08:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发生什么事了 约翰修士\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it, brother John.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.38,0:08:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王的信函\N{\fnArial\fs30}A letter from the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.32,0:08:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们将被查禁\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are to be suppressed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.06,0:08:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是克伦威尔阁下的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the orders of Mr. Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.82,0:08:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不明白 给我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand. Give me the letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.34,0:08:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们有何冒犯之处 神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have we done, Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.50,0:09:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.68,0:09:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会有什么灾难降临\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is to become of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.85,0:09:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您会再次召见法国大使吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you ask the French Ambassador again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.83,0:09:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果弗兰西斯仍然不同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}if Francis will not relent and agree…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.24,0:09:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊丽莎白与其子联姻\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the marriage of Elizabeth to his son?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.10,0:09:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我会的 - 您不认为此事很重要吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I might. - Don't you think it's important?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.08,0:09:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您难道不为我们女儿的未来考虑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't you think the future of your daughter is important?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.18,0:09:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我当然重视此事 - 那么 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course, I do. - Well then, I.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.02,0:09:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你完全明白被弗兰西斯拒绝这桩婚事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely you understand that Francis' refusal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.99,0:09:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是何等屈辱\N{\fnArial\fs30}to agree to the marriage in the first place was insulting!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.90,0:09:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要我再回去乞求吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want me to go back and beg?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.58,0:09:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 当然不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.37,0:10:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetheart…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.64,0:10:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已经确认过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's been tasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.37,0:10:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}食物没有毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not poisonous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.99,0:10:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事实上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fact of the matter is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.01,0:10:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}寻求与神圣罗马帝国结盟也许对我们更有利\N{\fnArial\fs30}it might be better for us to pursue an alliance with the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.15,0:10:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 这可合了凯瑟琳的意 - 这与凯瑟琳无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That would suit Katherine! - It has nothing to do with Katherine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.51,0:10:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是为了英格兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has to do with England.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.06,0:10:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}出于国家利益的考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}And England's interests.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.08,0:10:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毕竟 这才是我本应关注的\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all, I am supposed to be concerned with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.07,0:10:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉 宽恕我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.48,0:10:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不必道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no reason to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.50,0:10:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你关心的是我们的女儿 你当该如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}You care for our daughter, as you should.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.03,0:11:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但国家大事交由我来处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}But leave the greater things to my care.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.77,0:11:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听懂了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.85,0:11:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能邀请大人伉俪前来\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a pleasure to have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.17,0:11:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不胜荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your lovely wife to serve Your Grace!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.32,0:11:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟我说说 你查禁了一些修道院？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So tell me, you're suppressing some religious houses?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.42,0:11:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 才刚刚开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am starting to, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.53,0:11:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有其它措施吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hm! And what else?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.79,0:11:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我打算废除开庭期间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am intending to abolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.90,0:11:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和收获期间的\N{\fnArial\fs30}almost all the holy days that fall during the law terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.35,0:11:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}几乎所有宗教节日\N{\fnArial\fs30}and during the harvest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.54,0:11:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些强制性的节日 严重影响了国家的经济\N{\fnArial\fs30}These forced holidays, they damage the country's economy,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.20,0:11:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阻碍了重要的行业 事实上他们使工人们穷困潦倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}stop vital works, and in fact, they also impoverish workers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.14,0:11:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些牧师你们打算怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the priests?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.08,0:11:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至于那些神职人员 我们打算出台一系列法令\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as the clergy are concerned, we mean to issue a set of injunctions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.52,0:11:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要求他们大力鼓吹君权至尊\N{\fnArial\fs30}requiring them to preach the Supremacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.15,0:12:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有一条法令是要求父母教导孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will also be an injunction requiring parents and employers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.12,0:12:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雇主教导仆人 学习用英语而不是拉丁语写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}to teach their children and servants the Lord's Prayer,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.54,0:12:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}祈祷文 教义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Creed and the Ten Commandments in English.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.52,0:12:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及十诫\N{\fnArial\fs30}rather than in Latin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.43,0:12:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有的神职人员都会被提示\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all clerics will be put on notice to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.05,0:12:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去攻击围绕肖像和遗物的迷信祭拜活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}the superstitious cult surrounding images and relics.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.29,0:12:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们会被告知 与其费精力财力在遗物上\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will be told it will more profit their souls to bestow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.48,0:12:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不如救助贫困 更使他们的灵魂获益\N{\fnArial\fs30}upon the poor and the needy what they currently waste on relics.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.50,0:12:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这很好 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's very good, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.01,0:12:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但请允许我提个意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}But allow me to chide you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.28,0:12:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得你们做得还不够深入 不够迅速\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think that you're going far enough, or fast enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.05,0:12:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯 令夫人是个激进分子阿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wife is, uh, quite radical, Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.44,0:12:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 还是非法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is. And illegal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.76,0:12:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为这两个原因要把她藏起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two reasons to hide her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.33,0:12:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不能嘲笑我是躲箱子里偷运进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being carried around in a box does not make you laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.70,0:12:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的 对于这件事我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear, I am sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.43,0:12:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不是你的「亲爱的」 我不是任何人的「亲爱的」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not your "dear." I am nobody's "dear!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.95,0:12:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是个女人 我要求我的想法能得到同等的尊重\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a woman and I demand equal respect for my ideas!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.25,0:13:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对我而言 天主教的所作所为是邪恶的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For me, the practices of the Catholic church are evil!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.94,0:13:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们把无知的民众蒙在鼓里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way people are kept in total ignorance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.79,0:13:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让他们为自己的身躯和思想感到罪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}and made to feel guilty about their own bodies and their own thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.65,0:13:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚至于 传播富人可以为他们的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}And even worse, the idea that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.87,0:13:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在天堂购置安息之地的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}the rich can buy a plot in heaven for their souls!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.26,0:13:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我同意 天主教会已经堕落了 无可救药了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree with you.The Catholic Church is corrupted. It's irredeemable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.62,0:13:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你就应该毫不留情地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you should smash and destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.66,0:13:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}彻底 完全地摧毁它\N{\fnArial\fs30}utterly and totally and without pity,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.68,0:13:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是我的建议 克伦威尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}that is my advice to you, Mr. Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.79,0:13:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在你可以把我放回箱子里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you can put me back in my box!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.23,0:13:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚安 主教大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening…Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.25,0:13:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚安 大臣阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, Mr. Secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.47,0:13:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 好了 - 驾\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ready. - Hia! Giddyap!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.92,0:14:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为什么在这里 托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here, Thomas?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.21,0:14:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来看我们的落魄的样子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}To see the degradation that we have been forced to?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.86,0:14:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.34,0:14:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不想看到这样 我不明白你为何要留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like to see it. I wonder why you stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.80,0:14:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么你不回到宫廷里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you come back to court?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.51,0:14:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我爱戴王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.66,0:14:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有什么能让我离她而去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing in this world will make me leave her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.89,0:14:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是天主教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a Catholic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.88,0:14:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信我的信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe in my faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.55,0:14:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许你们诗人什么都不相信？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you poets don't believe in anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.09,0:14:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许我们相信爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}In love, perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.75,0:14:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我允许你吻我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may kiss me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.03,0:14:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后离开我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you will leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.43,0:15:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}永远别再来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.32,0:15:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊丽莎白…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabeth…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.59,0:15:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阁下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.66,0:15:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请原谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.86,0:16:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我本应该提前通知您我即将来访的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have warned you of my impending visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.71,0:16:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请问你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.72,0:16:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我叫约翰·里兰 我是国王陛下的图书管理员\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is John Leland.I am His Majesty's librarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.93,0:16:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想你在修道院中有个图书馆是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep a library in the priory, I believe?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.20,0:16:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确实如此 里兰先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do, indeed, Mr. Leland.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.89,0:16:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}藏书中有很多杰出而古老的手稿和书本\N{\fnArial\fs30}It contains many fine and old manuscripts and texts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.65,0:16:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们为此而骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are very proud of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.35,0:16:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王任命我仔细搜查所有隶属于\N{\fnArial\fs30}The King has commissioned me to peruse and diligently search.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.16,0:16:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将被查禁的宗教机构下的图书馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the libraries belonging to those religious houses about to be suppressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.34,0:16:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王迫切地希望来保管\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is anxious to preserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.13,0:16:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有他们的文学瑰宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}all their literary treasures.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.27,0:16:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你是说你要从这里取走这些资料？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You mean you intend to remove them from here? - Naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.84,0:16:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们将被收藏于王室图书馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will be housed in the Royal Libraries.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.89,0:16:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.85,0:16:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下还下令 让我查找\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty has also ordered me to find texts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.62,0:16:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}强调王权至尊和认同新君主专制政体的文字\N{\fnArial\fs30}that would emphasize the Royal Supremacy and the New Monarchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.36,0:16:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里兰先生 我认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not think, Mr. Leland,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.22,0:17:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不会在这儿找到多少那样的文字\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you will find many such texts here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.11,0:17:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王后陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.46,0:17:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.93,0:17:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的心肝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my own heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.46,0:17:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}妈… 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma… mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.16,0:17:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.32,0:17:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可以下去了 布赖恩女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may leave us now, Lady Bryan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.07,0:17:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的小宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.27,0:17:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我的小甜心 - 你为什么走了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My sweetheart… - Why do you leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.89,0:17:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 有没有想我？- 想\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have you missed me? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.00,0:17:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想我了？我也想你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You missed me? I missed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.18,0:17:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}日思夜想\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.45,0:18:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这儿 还有这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here! And here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.43,0:18:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看到一条\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see one!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.42,0:18:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看到一条 我看到一条鱼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see one! I see a fishie!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.54,0:18:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你哪儿看到鱼了 小宝贝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you see a fishie, my darling?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.54,0:18:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你最近和王后谈过吗？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have you talked to the Queen recently?- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.87,0:18:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她让我开始担心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's giving me cause for concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.24,0:18:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}任何人都看得出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone can see that the King is not so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.81,0:18:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王不再像从前那么爱她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}in love with her as he used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.11,0:18:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.22,0:18:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不清楚 也许她是在害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Perhaps she's afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.15,0:18:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可怜的乔治 你变得毫无主见了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor George. Have you gone softheaded?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.98,0:18:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我？没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.44,0:18:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.02,0:18:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道的 乔治 风险太大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, George, the stakes are too high.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.53,0:18:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今日做胆小的懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever is a coward now will soon rue the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.27,0:18:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他日必定悔不当初\N{\fnArial\fs30}and regret his misfortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.19,0:18:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}成功之人只会在他人身上看到恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Successful people only recognize fear in others.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.10,0:18:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去和你的妹妹再谈一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go and talk to your sister again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.53,0:19:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 好点没？- 好多了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Better? - Much, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.53,0:19:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}女士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.30,0:19:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样是不是更好了 乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this not better, George?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.33,0:19:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.74,0:19:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 能请你跳舞吗 大人？- 现在不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Will you dance, My Lord? - No. Not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.32,0:19:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.94,0:19:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每次都这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.33,0:19:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还爱着她\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're still in love with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.36,0:19:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你错了 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong, My Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.43,0:19:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的爱萌发和消逝在很久之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}My love was sprung and spent a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.48,0:20:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.92,0:20:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.76,0:20:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mark!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.96,0:20:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拉一曲沃尔塔（旋转舞）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play a volta.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.14,0:23:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还想要怀孕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to conceive again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.20,0:23:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想怀个儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to conceive a son.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.92,0:23:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个传承其父亲血脉的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A son to be the living image of his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.34,0:23:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.01,0:23:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.05,0:23:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要他们还活着 我就怀不了儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as they're alive, I can't conceive a son.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.87,0:23:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.71,0:24:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳和她的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katherine and her daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.31,0:24:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是想要我处死她们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you saying you want me to kill them?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.78,0:24:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.07,0:24:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.42,0:24:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 伊丽莎白 - 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Elizabeth. - Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.70,0:25:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经有四年多没见到我的女儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have not seen my daughter for more than four years.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.76,0:25:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把我们分隔开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it not cruel of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.49,0:25:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们这样是不是很残忍？\N{\fnArial\fs30}to keep her from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.21,0:25:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尊贵的夫人 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentle Madam, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.24,0:25:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这让我伤心欲裂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It burns my heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.55,0:25:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请再读一次元老院的判书给我听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Read the Curia's Judgment to me again. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.57,0:25:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们郑重宣告 亨利八世\N{\fnArial\fs30}"We pronounce that the marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.37,0:25:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和阿拉贡的凯瑟琳之间的婚姻\N{\fnArial\fs30}"between Henry VIII and Katherine of Aragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.78,0:25:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确凿而且符合教规\N{\fnArial\fs30}"stands firm and canonical,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.84,0:25:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们的子嗣\N{\fnArial\fs30}"and their issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.20,0:25:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}依然合法正当\N{\fnArial\fs30}still stands lawful and legitimate."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.81,0:26:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看到了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.15,0:26:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是永恒的事实…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the eternal truth…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.06,0:26:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无人能否定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}which no man can ever deny.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.97,0:26:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}圣父 诸位主教大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy Father, Eminences,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.90,0:26:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们即将商议的下一个议题是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next item for our deliberation.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.91,0:26:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亚历山卓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alessandro!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.31,0:26:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我好好看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me look at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.54,0:26:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瞧 瞧 瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.00,0:26:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都长这么大了 快成一名男子汉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}how you've grown! You're almost a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.67,0:26:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 做人要清正廉洁啊？- 是 爷爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you honest and clean? - Si, grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.08,0:26:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}祈祷时 你有真正心怀谦卑吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you pray to God, are you truly humble?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.26,0:26:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.53,0:26:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.74,0:27:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去玩吧 假以时日定会是名杰出主教\N{\fnArial\fs30}Off you go. He'll make a fine Cardinal.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.67,0:27:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们觉得呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.17,0:27:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}诸位大人 我们还有其他要事相商\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsignors, we have other business to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.03,0:27:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其一 我邀请了名匠米开朗琪罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, I have invited the sculptor Michelangelo to paint.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.06,0:27:22.71,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为西斯廷教堂绘上《最后的审判》\N{\fnArial\fs30}a Last Judgment in the Sistine Chapel.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.80,0:27:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}圣父 仍然有一部分大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy Father, there are still people.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.56,0:27:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}反对在天花板绘制他的作品\N{\fnArial\fs30}who object to his work on the ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.55,0:27:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我明白 我一度反对 但现在的确喜欢他的画\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I did myself. But now I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.56,0:27:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这项工程会不会造价昂贵？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't the Judgment be expensive?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.55,0:27:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不会 我们无需支付太多的酬劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We won't pay him very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.84,0:27:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毕竟 他不过是名画匠\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's only an artist, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.56,0:27:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英格兰王的「要事」如何处理？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What of the King of England's Great Matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.86,0:27:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来给诸位讲个故事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will tell you a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.21,0:27:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}年少时 有一次 我去游泳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once, when I was a boy, I went swimming,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.07,0:27:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}潮水把我冲走\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the tide carried me away,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.06,0:27:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}远离海岸\N{\fnArial\fs30}far from the shore,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.52,0:27:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}冲入深海\N{\fnArial\fs30}into the deepest water.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.04,0:28:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当时 我开始大声祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was then I prayed aloud to God,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.10,0:28:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后一个波浪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a friendly wave came.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.13,0:28:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又把冲回岸边\N{\fnArial\fs30}and pushed me back to the shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.90,0:28:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英格兰王也亦然\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it is with the King of England.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.57,0:28:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他被淫风恶浪冲离海岸\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has been carried far from the shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.03,0:28:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而他却毫不知情\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he does not know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.44,0:28:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他没有祈求上帝的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does not ask for God's help.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.05,0:28:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也没有请求我们的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does not ask for our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.24,0:28:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他自认为可以独自弄潮\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thinks he can swim alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.27,0:28:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但很快他就会意识到\N{\fnArial\fs30}But very soon he will realize.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.57,0:28:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不是在游水而是在溺水\N{\fnArial\fs30}he is not swimming but drowning.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.64,0:28:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快 快…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allez! Allez…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.13,0:28:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你哭哭啼啼地像个婴儿似的做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you crying like a baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.13,0:28:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些不过是泥胎木像\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are nothing but idols!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.10,0:28:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快 快…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allez! Allez…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.81,0:29:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}神父 这伙人是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father, who are these men?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.55,0:29:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来自法兰西的布里多尼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bretons. From France.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.80,0:29:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 胡格诺派教徒 - 新教徒？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Huguenots. - Protestants?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.44,0:29:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对 大概克伦威尔大臣阁下觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Perhaps Mr. Secretary Cromwell felt that he couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.73,0:29:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不能靠英国人来摧毁他们自己的传统\N{\fnArial\fs30}trust Englishmen to destroy their own heritage.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.77,0:29:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玷污他们自己的信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}and besmirch their own faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.31,0:29:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王后驾到\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.08,0:29:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Majesty. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.83,0:29:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Majesty. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.02,0:29:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Majesty. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.09,0:29:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 有何吩咐 陛下 - 我来见国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me. Your Majesty. - I came to see the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.67,0:29:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 国王陛下今天早早就和沙福克公爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam, His Majesty left early this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.70,0:29:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}出宫打猎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to go hunting with the Duke of Suffolk…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.33,0:29:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}… 还有其他贵族\N{\fnArial\fs30}and other nobles.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.42,0:29:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沙福克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suffolk?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.37,0:29:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.29,0:29:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想起来了 大王和我说过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember now. He told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.37,0:30:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Majesty. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.11,0:30:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Majesty. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.19,0:30:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}干的漂亮 要启驾回宫了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A good kill. Do you want to get back to the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.97,0:30:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 附近有可以留宿的地方吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Is there somewhere around here we can stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.30,0:30:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有沃尔福宅邸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, there's Wulfhall.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.83,0:30:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沃尔福宅邸 房子的主人是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wulfhall. Who owns that house?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.80,0:30:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰·西摩爵士一家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir John Seymour and his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.06,0:30:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我记得约翰爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember Sir John.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.20,0:30:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在法兰西和我们并肩战斗过\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was in France with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.40,0:31:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们去吧 给他个惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go surprise him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.42,0:31:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}驾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hia!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.76,0:32:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰爵士 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir John! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.55,0:32:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰爵士 约翰爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir John! Sir John!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.89,0:32:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来者何人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this shouting?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.72,0:32:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰爵士 你有位不速之客\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir John, you have an unexpected guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.90,0:32:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 约翰爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Majesty! - Sir John.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.83,0:32:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不胜欢迎之至\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are most welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.07,0:33:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主阿 你到我舍下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Domine, non sum dignus.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.93,0:33:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不敢当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ut intres sub tectum meum:
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.29,0:33:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要你说一句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sed tantum dic verbo,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.40,0:33:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的仆人就必好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Et sanabitur anima mea.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.91,0:33:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主耶稣基督\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corpus domini nostri jesu christi.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.14,0:33:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}愿您的圣体保佑获得永生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Custodiat tu in vitam aeternam.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.12,0:33:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.85,0:33:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}厨子们办事拖沓 肯请陛下海涵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty must forgive the tardiness of my kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.62,0:33:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朕深感约翰爵士招待热情 无微不至\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I am very well looked after, Sir John.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.55,0:33:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朕刚刚还和公爵谈到法兰西之战\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Duke and I were reminiscing about the French campaign.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.24,0:33:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.49,0:33:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只和他们对阵一次 实在是可惜啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a shame we only fought one battle against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.66,0:34:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 但那是何等的战役啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, but what a battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.87,0:34:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}微臣清楚记得 我军是如何对他们发起冲锋的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember how we charged at them, with His Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.57,0:34:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵大人领军向前 勇敢无比\N{\fnArial\fs30}leading the vanguard with tremendous bravery.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.02,0:34:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法兰西阵脚大乱 兵败如山倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how the French were broken and routed in the charge and fled the field before us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.69,0:34:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一眼望去 尽是被遗弃的马刺\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we saw were their spurs!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.77,0:34:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}微臣需如实向陛下相告\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must tell Your Majesty that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.75,0:34:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}米兰大使对您可是仰慕不已啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Milanese Ambassador was amazed by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.94,0:34:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他对微臣说\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.23,0:34:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「英王居然在战后比当初更加精神百倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The King was fresher after his exertion than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.88,0:34:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道他何以至此「\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not know how he can stand it!"
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.02,0:34:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为过去的胜利干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}To past victories.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.37,0:34:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为爵士干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}To John.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.48,0:34:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.78,0:34:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.95,0:35:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的宝贝女儿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daughter…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.64,0:35:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的小心肝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sweetheart!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.19,0:35:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.29,0:35:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别哭 别哭 让妈妈好好看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't weep. Don't weep. Let me look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.77,0:35:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}乖 不哭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.93,0:35:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}妈妈太久没有看到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have not seen you for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.03,0:35:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恍若隔世啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}An eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.70,0:35:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}终于见到你啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.03,0:35:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 我的乖宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my sweet child!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.28,0:35:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的挚爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}My beloved child,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.44,0:35:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的小天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}my angel,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.01,0:35:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}my world…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.58,0:35:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.17,0:35:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的珍爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mi preciosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.26,0:35:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她来过这了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.83,0:35:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她来看我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She came to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.27,0:35:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 夫人 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Madam. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.51,0:36:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我去召个御医吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me summon a doctor for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.18,0:36:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I don't want a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.05,0:36:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经把自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have wholly committed myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.01,0:36:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全然托付给上帝的意愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the pleasure of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.57,0:36:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}愿万能的主…\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the omnipotent God…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.36,0:36:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怜悯您\N{\fnArial\fs30}have mercy upon you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.26,0:36:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}宽恕您的罪过\N{\fnArial\fs30}and forgive you your sins,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.46,0:36:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}愿耶稣基督带你走向永生\N{\fnArial\fs30}and may Jesus Christ lead you to eternal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.89,0:36:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马克 我伤心欲绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Mark. I'm so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.78,0:36:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所为何事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why sad?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.62,0:36:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是我生的是男孩…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I had a son…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.77,0:36:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是我生的是男孩 我将带来辉煌盛世\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I had a son, it would bring about a golden world.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.49,0:37:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此海泥 我倒是前所未见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had never seen a sea of mud like that before!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.61,0:37:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一时不知所措 我是说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't quite know what to think of it. I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.32,0:37:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当时您的战马两只后腿都陷进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When your horse sank up to its hind quarters in it,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.41,0:37:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我永远都记得您的表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall never forget your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.23,0:37:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我还能怎么办？- 我满身盔甲呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What was I supposed to do? - I was in full armor!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.74,0:37:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 请允许我介绍我女儿 珍·西摩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, may I present my daughter, Lady Jane Seymour.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.23,0:38:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}珍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.41,0:38:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.14,0:38:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克伦威尔大人觐见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Secretary Cromwell is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.75,0:38:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 您要召见我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam. You wished to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.78,0:38:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我父亲告诉我 您决定关闭英国境内\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father tells me you are determined to close.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.27,0:38:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有的修道院 此事是否属实\N{\fnArial\fs30}every religious house in England. Is it true?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.31,0:38:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确有此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.63,0:38:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}诚如陛下所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}As Your Majesty knows,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.31,0:38:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教会的调查专员发现欺诈 玩忽职守\N{\fnArial\fs30}the church commissioners found that fraud, laxity.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.31,0:38:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和滥用职权已经成了正常现象\N{\fnArial\fs30}and abuse were commonplace.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.93,0:39:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可有些教堂也获好评 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet some religious houses received good report. Is that not also true?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.49,0:39:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还听说修道院的一切财富和资产\N{\fnArial\fs30}I also hear that all the wealth and assets of the monasteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.93,0:39:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都将转入国王名下\N{\fnArial\fs30}are to be transferred to the King's Treasury.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.55,0:39:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确实如此 我希望让国王成为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed. I intend to make the King the most powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.30,0:39:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}整个欧洲最强大最富有的国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the richest King in Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.46,0:39:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是有些财富完全可以发挥更大的作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}But surely some of that wealth could be put to better uses!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.55,0:39:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 更大的作用 夫人？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Better uses, Madam? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.75,0:39:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比如慈善捐赠和教育事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}For endowments to charitable and educational causes,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.45,0:39:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}连渥西都知道这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}which even Wolsey did!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.74,0:39:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 听到您质疑国王钦定的的政策\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam, I am surprised to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.50,0:39:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我感到非常意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}you question the King's policy,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.12,0:39:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您的父兄对此也是全力支持的\N{\fnArial\fs30}which your father and brother whole-heartedly support.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.99,0:39:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我质疑的是政策本身 大臣阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I question the policy, Mr. Secretary,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.50,0:39:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我不相信这是国王制定的法令\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I am not convinced that it is the King's.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.18,0:39:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 夫人 - 克伦威尔先生 您过于骄纵跋扈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Madam, I… - You are far too high-handed, Mr. Cromwell!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.00,0:39:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要小心一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ought to be careful,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.37,0:39:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不然小心你的脑袋难保\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I will have you cropped at the neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.30,0:40:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}愿全能慈悲的天主广施仁慈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutionem et remissionem omnium peccatorum…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.73,0:40:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赦免我等罪过\N{\fnArial\fs30}vestrorum, misericors Dominus. Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.78,0:40:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道我快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that I must die.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.25,0:40:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我恳请主清算我的罪孽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ask that my debts be cleared.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.91,0:40:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且我的仆人因她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my servants be recompensed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.54,0:40:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对我精心的服侍\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the good service.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.77,0:40:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}得到应得的报偿\N{\fnArial\fs30}they have done for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.78,0:40:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我期望被埋葬在信徒聚居的女修道院\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish to be buried in the convent of the Observant Friars.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.24,0:40:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我期望我的灵魂会有500次弥撒来祷告\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I would wish that 500 masses be said for my soul…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.78,0:40:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会有人去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that someone would visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.86,0:41:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}位于沃尔辛海姆的圣母神殿\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Shrine of our Lady of Walsingham.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.12,0:41:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}替我祷告\N{\fnArial\fs30}to pray on my behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.15,0:41:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而我的女儿 玛丽…\N{\fnArial\fs30}To my daughter, Mary…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.02,0:41:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将会把我从西班牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I leave the collar of gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.22,0:41:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}带来的黄金项圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought from Spain…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.57,0:41:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和皮草留给她…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my furs…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.61,0:41:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 我来帮您\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam, let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.03,0:41:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 我忠诚的善良的伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, my loyal and loving Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.98,0:41:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我必须要给国王写信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must write to the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.58,0:41:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「亲爱的夫君钧鉴…\N{\fnArial\fs30}"My Lord and dear husband…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.05,0:41:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「臣妾敬禀\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I commend me unto you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.73,0:41:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}值吾大限迫近久病沉痾之际\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The hour of my death draws fast on, and my case being such…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.80,0:41:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对你的绵绵爱意\N{\fnArial\fs30}"the tender love I owe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.57,0:42:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}促使我牵挂你的安康和你灵魂的安宁\N{\fnArial\fs30}"forces me to put you in remembrance of the health and safeguard of your soul…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.50,0:42:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然思前想后你还是选择了肉体的需求\N{\fnArial\fs30}"which you ought to prefer above all considerations of the world of flesh whatsoever,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.08,0:42:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并为此将我置于痛苦的深渊\N{\fnArial\fs30}"for which you have cast me into many miseries,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.33,0:42:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由此你自身亦忧虑缠身\N{\fnArial\fs30}"and yourself into many cares.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.17,0:42:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对我而言\N{\fnArial\fs30}"For my part…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.03,0:42:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我全然宽恕你的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I do pardon you all,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.97,0:42:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}诚如斯言\N{\fnArial\fs30}"yea,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.27,0:42:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我期望并向我主祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}"and I do wish and pray dearly God.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.71,0:42:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恳求他也能宽恕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}"that He will pardon you also.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.53,0:42:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}置诸其他事项\N{\fnArial\fs30}"For the rest,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.95,0:42:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}专此奉禀\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I commend unto you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.34,0:42:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对于我们的女儿 玛丽…\N{\fnArial\fs30}"our daughter, Mary…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.63,0:43:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如我一直渴望那样 伏祈你以慈父待她\N{\fnArial\fs30}"beseeching you to be a good father unto her as I have always desired.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.61,0:43:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最后\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And lastly…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.63,0:43:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I vow…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.02,0:43:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}期盼见你一面乃我无上之愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}"that mine eyes desire you above all things."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.68,0:43:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊丽莎白 帮我一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabeth, help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.49,0:44:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的帮助在于上主的圣名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adjutorium Domini ets.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.98,0:44:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}祂创造天与地 阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}qui fecit caelum et terram, Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.26,0:44:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父阿 我将我的灵魂交在你手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In manus tuas commendo spiritum meum.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.82,0:45:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.45,0:45:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}南 什么事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it, Nan?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.14,0:45:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在我是真正的王后了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I am indeed Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.81,0:45:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabeth?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.04,0:46:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabeth…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.97,0:46:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.95,0:46:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabeth…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.35,0:48:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 噢 - 约翰 这是我太太 凯瑟琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh! - John. This is my wife, Catherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.44,0:48:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir John.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.13,0:48:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王后陛下到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here comes Her Majesty now.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.52,0:48:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 夫人 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My Lady. - Your Majesties.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.63,0:48:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两位陛下 亲爱的你去看会斗鸡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesties. Go watch the cockfight, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.61,0:48:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 夫人 - 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My Lady. - My Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.64,0:48:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马克 今天没表演吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not performing today, Mark?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.69,0:48:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 今天没有 阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not today, My Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.28,0:48:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过今晚晚些时候可以？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But perhaps later tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.50,0:48:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.54,0:48:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你告诉她我的事了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you told her about me? Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.46,0:49:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我的事？- 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- About us? - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.02,0:49:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到底为什么不说？你可是乔治·波林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the hell not? You're George Boleyn!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.53,0:49:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这你就像个铁血教父一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're like a bloody god around here!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.89,0:49:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斯米顿大师 如果你懂希腊语的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you could read Greek, Master Smeaton,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.60,0:49:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就会知道连神都搞不定老婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd know that even the gods had problems with their wives!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.76,0:49:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 约翰爵士 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir John. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.82,0:49:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们想向您的慷慨好客再次表示感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wanted to thank you once more for your generous hospitality.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.60,0:49:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且我们不请自来 尤其如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the more so because our visit was so unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.04,0:49:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 这是我们最大的荣誉和快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sire, it was the greatest possible privilege and pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.12,0:49:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下睡过的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the room Your Majesty slept in.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.93,0:49:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将被永久命名为「国王的房间」\N{\fnArial\fs30}shall forever be known as "The King's bedroom."
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.34,0:49:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您的女儿珍应该进宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your daughter Jane should come to court.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.77,0:49:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 服侍王后陛下 - 万分感谢 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- As lady to Her Majesty. - Thank you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.90,0:49:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您给了我们家族无比荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do our family a great honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.50,0:50:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}宝贝 到这来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetheart. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.22,0:50:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 爸爸 - 哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Papa!- Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.69,0:50:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Elizabeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.09,0:50:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 警卫 警卫 保护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! Guards! Guards! Protect me!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.91,0:50:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快点来人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.09,0:50:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警卫 你们快点保护我 保护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}En garde! You're going to protect me. Protect me!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.20,0:50:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 保护国王 - 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Protect your King! - My mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.53,0:50:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.33,0:50:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}My papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.07,0:50:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.43,0:50:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.77,0:50:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么事 父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.54,0:50:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听到些让人警觉的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have heard some reports that alarm me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.25,0:50:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}What reports?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.29,0:50:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好像你跟克伦威尔先生有点争执\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems you have quarreled with Mr. Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.85,0:50:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们在\N{\fnArial\fs30}We disagreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.37,0:51:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一件非常重要的公众事宜上意见不和\N{\fnArial\fs30}on an important and public issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.90,0:51:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安妮 我把你捧上这个位子不是要你自作主张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anne, I did not bring you up to have opinions.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.65,0:51:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或表达意见 或与国王亲近的人去争吵\N{\fnArial\fs30}or to express them or to quarrel with those closest to the Crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.55,0:51:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我才是国王最亲近的 我是国王的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I am closest to the Crown! I am the King's wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.72,0:51:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要记清楚你是怎么走到这一步来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you should remember how you got there!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.82,0:51:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道我怎么走到这的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how I got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.67,0:51:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是全靠你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it was not all you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.37,0:51:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是全靠你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was not all you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.98,0:51:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也不是诺福克或者乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}or Norfolk or George.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.32,0:51:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更不是任何其他你要说的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}or any other man you want to name!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.05,0:51:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也有我的功劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was also me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.85,0:51:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他爱上的人是我 他尊重的是我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He fell in love with me. He respected me…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.28,0:51:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和我的见解\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my opinions.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.54,0:51:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你笑什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.46,0:51:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你用不着担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.86,0:51:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到处都是好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is good news all round.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.98,0:51:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳已经死了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katherine is dead…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.43,0:52:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.83,0:52:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已经怀孕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.42,0:52:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.26,0:52:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我怀着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am carrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.81,0:52:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}the King's son.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.33,0:52:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们面前是个金色的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are on the edge of a golden world!
